{"version":1,"content":"<p>【天啊 !!】有了 AI 後真的沒什麼不可能 !! 近日社交媒體上出現了大量 Android 機原生運行 iOS 的示範影片。</p><p>這個名為「UniXNU」的專案終於在 GitHub 上正式發布，它透過統一可延伸韌體介面（UEFI），讓非 Apple 的 ARM64 架構硬體能夠成功運行 iOS 與 macOS 作業系統，目前已支援 63 款不同裝置。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:45.224488+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T15:42:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:27.790556+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.772276+00:00","content_hash":"0d423b12f337cc287766264b0b14a33082db3775688099a2f117cc898e830ebd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}